/*
    
    launchSettings.json

    This file must be edited to specify the workingDirectory
    attribute for each profile on the target system. The
    workingDirectory should be set to the path to acad.exe 
    for each launch profile.
  
    You don't have to edit the executablePath, so long as 
    acad.exe is the executable you want to launch, and it 
    resides in the path specified in the workingDiretory 
    attribute.

    You can also delete profiles for AutoCAD releases
    you are not targeting.
    
*/

